  "sourceTitle": "Frozen Wine Slushie",
  "sourceText": "Frozen Wine Slushie\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Tuesday, December 15, 2009 - 1:23pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 1/2 liters Red wine\n12 ounces Limeade, frozen concentrate\n12 ounces Water\n7 -Up\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Mix all ingredients except 7-up. Freeze in ice cube trays or large container. Fill glass with frozen wine cubes or slushie wine and add 7-up.",
